<title>JAPAN: Bank of Japan drains 600 bln yen from money market.</title>
<headline>Bank of Japan drains 600 bln yen from money market.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Japan (BOJ) drained a net 600 billion yen from the money market on Monday, money traders said.</p>
<p>The market had a projected 710 billion yen surplus before the BOJ's operation, they said.</p>
<p>---Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-3432-8676</p>
